# What the image builds (Dockerfile, Dockerfile.ax) do not need. The context is addons/ax, and the builds read only the
# module's Go packages.
*.md
**/*.test
bin
# At any depth: a pattern without **/ matches only at the root of the context.
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/kubeconfig*
# A local run's SQLite store and its journal files.
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
